IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgi-director-transactions`

-- Tests for sgi-director-transactions.l4 (ss 25C and 25D). Expected values are written from the text beside each assertion.

§ `s 25C(1) and (2)`

-- Applies "if or to the extent that its validity depends on section 25B".
#ASSERT `s 25C(1) section 25C applies to the transaction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Its validity does not depend on s 25B: the "if" fails, the text's no.
#ASSERT `s 25C(1) section 25C applies to the transaction` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2): the section does not exclude another law by which the transaction may be called in question or a liability may arise.
#ASSERT `s 25C(2) section 25C excludes the operation of the other written law or rule of law` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25C(2) section 25C excludes the operation of the other written law or rule of law` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25C(3): voidable at the instance of the company`

-- Company entered into a transaction to which s 25C applies, and a party is a director (i): voidable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(3) the transaction is voidable at the instance of the company` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A party is a person connected with such a director (ii): voidable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(3) the transaction is voidable at the instance of the company` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Both: voidable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(3) the transaction is voidable at the instance of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Neither limb of paragraph (b): the "where" fails (the periods ruling, item (b)).
#ASSERT `s 25C(3) the transaction is voidable at the instance of the company` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Paragraph (a) fails (s 25C does not apply to the transaction): the "where" fails.
#ASSERT `s 25C(3) the transaction is voidable at the instance of the company` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 25C(4) and (6): who is liable, and for what`

-- A party who is a director or a person connected with a director: liable under (4).
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) the person is liable to the company under subsection (4)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A director who authorised the transaction: liable under (4).
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) the person is liable to the company under subsection (4)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Neither: the subsection names no one else (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) the person is liable to the company under subsection (4)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6): a person other than a director who shows he did not know the directors were exceeding their powers is not liable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(6) the person other than a director is liable under subsection (4)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A director who shows that: (6) does not help him (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `s 25C(6) the person other than a director is liable under subsection (4)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A person other than a director who does not show it: (6) says nothing.
#ASSERT `s 25C(6) the person other than a director is liable under subsection (4)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Together (4) and (6): a connected party who is not a director and shows no knowledge is not liable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) and (6) the person is liable to the company` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A connected party who is not a director and does not show it is liable.
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) and (6) the person is liable to the company` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A director who authorised the transaction is liable, whatever he says about knowledge.
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) and (6) the person is liable to the company` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Someone outside both classes: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25C(4) and (6) the person is liable to the company` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4)(a): the gain, for a liable person; (4)(b): the loss or damage.
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(a) the amount the person must account to the company for` TRUE 12500 EQUALS JUST 12500
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(a) the amount the person must account to the company for` FALSE 12500 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(b) the person must indemnify the company for the loss or damage` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(b) the person must indemnify the company for the loss or damage` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(b) the amount the person must indemnify the company for` TRUE 3000 EQUALS JUST 3000
#ASSERT `s 25C(4)(b) the amount the person must indemnify the company for` FALSE 3000 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25C(5): the transaction ceases to be voidable`

#ASSERT `s 25C(5) the transaction ceases to be voidable` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(5) the transaction ceases to be voidable` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(5) the transaction ceases to be voidable` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(5) the transaction ceases to be voidable` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None of (a) to (d): the "if" fails (reading (a) for a lawyer).
#ASSERT `s 25C(5) the transaction ceases to be voidable` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 25C(7) and (8)`

-- A party not within (3)(b)(i) or (ii): subsections (1) to (6) do not affect its rights.
#ASSERT `s 25C(7) subsections (1) to (6) affect the rights of the party` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25C(7) subsections (1) to (6) affect the rights of the party` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The court may make an order on the application of the company or such a party; with no such application, NOTHING (split site (ii)).
#ASSERT `s 25C(7) the court may make an order affirming, severing or setting aside the transaction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(7) the court may make an order affirming, severing or setting aside the transaction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8): "transaction" includes any act.
#ASSERT `s 25C(8) the thing is within the word transaction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25C(8) the thing is within the word transaction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25C(4): regulative rules, traced`

-- The duty to account has no time limit and no stated consequence, so no trace reaches BREACH. The act done: FULFILLED. No act: the duty stands (RESIDUAL).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 25C(4)(a) the person liable under subsection (4) must account to the company for any gain` "Ali" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Ali" DOES `s 25C(4)(a) account to the company for any gain made directly or indirectly by the transaction` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 25C(4)(a) the person liable under subsection (4) must account to the company for any gain` "Ali" AT 0 WITH
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 25C(4)(b) the person liable under subsection (4) must indemnify the company for any loss or damage` "Ali" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Ali" DOES `s 25C(4)(b) indemnify the company for any loss or damage resulting from the transaction` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 25C(4)(b) the person liable under subsection (4) must indemnify the company for any loss or damage` "Ali" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 25D(2): the meanings`

#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) spouse` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) son` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) adopted son` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) stepson` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) daughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) adopted daughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) stepdaughter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A sibling is not named, and "includes" leaves the list open: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(a) the person is a member of the director's family` `s 25D(2)(a) another relationship` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): at least 20% of the share capital (boundary 19.99 / 20), or more than 20% of the voting power (boundary 20 / 20.01).
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(b) the director is connected with the body corporate` 20 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(b) the director is connected with the body corporate` 19.99 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(b) the director is connected with the body corporate` 0 20.01 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(b) the director is connected with the body corporate` 0 20 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(b) the director is connected with the body corporate` 19 19 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c): voting power controlled by a body corporate controlled by the director counts.
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(c) the voting power counts as voting power the exercise of which is controlled by the director` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(c) the voting power counts as voting power the exercise of which is controlled by the director` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(c) the voting power counts as voting power the exercise of which is controlled by the director` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (d)(i): connected under (b) only: not treated as connected for subsection (2). Also connected under (1)(c) or (d): the paragraph is silent (NOTHING). Not connected under (b): outside it.
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(i) the body corporate is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(i) the body corporate is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(i) the body corporate is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (d)(ii): a trustee connected by reason only of a beneficiary body corporate is not treated as connected.
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(ii) the trustee is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(ii) the trustee is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(d)(ii) the trustee is treated as connected with the director for the purposes of subsection (2)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (e): a corporation sole or an unincorporated partnership is not a body corporate; a body incorporated outside Singapore is; a body incorporated in Singapore is not named.
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(e) the body is within the words body corporate` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(e) the body is within the words body corporate` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(e) the body is within the words body corporate` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(e) the body is within the words body corporate` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(2)(e) the body is within the words body corporate` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 25D(1): a person connected with a director`

-- Ruler for the positional records below, in the order of the DECLARE:
--   (a) family, (b) body corporate, (c) trustee, (c)(i), (c)(ii), (c) scheme trust, (d)(i), (d)(ii), (e) firm, (e)(i), (e)(ii), (e)(iii), (f) is a director
`a person within no paragraph` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a member of the director's family` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a body corporate with which the director is connected` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a trustee, beneficiaries include the director` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a trustee, power for the benefit of the director` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a trustee of an employees' share scheme trust` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a trustee with no beneficiary or power for the director` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a partner of the director` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a partner of a connected person` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a firm in which the director is a partner` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a firm with a connected partner` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`a firm with a partner that is a firm` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`a firm that is not a legal person` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`a firm that is a legal person with no such partner` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a family member who is himself a director` MEANS `s 25D(1) person` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE

#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a member of the director's family` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a body corporate with which the director is connected` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a trustee, beneficiaries include the director` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a trustee, power for the benefit of the director` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) "other than a trust for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or on a pension scheme": excluded.
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a trustee of an employees' share scheme trust` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a trustee with no beneficiary or power for the director` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a partner of the director` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a partner of a connected person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a firm in which the director is a partner` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a firm with a connected partner` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a firm with a partner that is a firm` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (e) is "a firm that is a legal person": a firm that is not one is not within (e).
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a firm that is not a legal person` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a firm that is a legal person with no such partner` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a person within no paragraph` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (f): a person who is himself a director of the company is not a person connected with a director.
#ASSERT `s 25D(1) the person is a person connected with the director` `a family member who is himself a director` EQUALS JUST FALSE
